                                        "entry_id": "ba30139d-af57-3f34-a125-d75f75d6fa53",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A foul-smelling diamine produced by protein hydrolysis during putrefaction of animal tissue. Cadaverine is a toxic diamine with the formula NH₂(CH₂)₅NH₂."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ce423d2-e3f6-4ab2-8a16-ebd9b1c9b6a3",
                                                "sense_id": "ec549a11-0cb3-33d9-a516-51633c349765",
                                                "text": "Fragrant gasses such as cadaverine and putrescine are treated with a biofilter before being released."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "41071bdc-4e75-4628-abdc-5066bc144a51",
